# Authored analytical P1 H2O stoichiometry fixture with a synthetic periodic cell.
# Not an equilibrium ice structure; no temperature-dependent data are implied.
# Row basis [2,0,0], [1,3,0], [1,2,4] Angstrom has det(cell)=24 Angstrom^3.
# Lengths and angles below are derived from that basis to 15 decimal places.
# Crystallographic fractional-coordinate convention reference:
# https://www.iucr.org/resources/cif/dictionaries/cif_core
# Density: 18.015 g/mol / (N_A * 24 Angstrom^3) = 1246.442137297369 kg/m^3.
# Test tolerances: relative 1e-12 geometry and 1e-10 density.
